<!DOCTYPE html> <html> <head> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <style> * { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background-color: #f2f2f2;
  margin: 0;
}

.container {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin: 100px auto;
  max-width: 800px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

h1 {
  color: #ff6600;
  text-align: center;
}

h2 {
  color: #ff6600;
  font-size: 24px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}

p {
  font-size: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  text-align: justify;
}

a.button {
  background-color: #ff6600;
  color: #ffffff;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.thanks {
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  text-align: center;
}

.signature {
  font-size: 18px;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.footer {
  background-color: #333;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
}

/* Added to remove top navbar and make body background light gray */

.navbar {
  display: none;
}

body {
  background-color: #f2f2f2;
}
</style> </head> <body> <nav class="navbar"> <!-- Navbar content goes here --> </nav> <div class="container"> <h1>Congratulations</h1> <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p> <p>Greetings from COD King! We are pleased to inform you that your request to use COD King's WhatsApp account has been <b>approved</b> after careful review.</p> <h2>Next Steps</h2> <p>To enable WhatsApp Messages, click the button below and follow the instructions:</p> <a href="https://<%= @shopify_domain %>/admin/apps/cod-verification/?qTab=Notification" target="_blank" class="button">Enable WhatsApp Messages</a> <p>If you need any help or have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us via chat:</p> <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank" class="button">Chat with us now!</a> <p class="thanks">Thank you for being a valued customer of COD King.</p> <p class="signature">Best regards,<br>The COD King Team</p> </div> <div class="footer"> &copy; COD King | All rights reserved </div> </body> </html>